        "claim": "The plugin path moves from plugins/labdrian-runtime-parity.js to plugins/labdrian-runtime-parity/index.js, but neither install nor uninstall removes the old file. An existing installation keeps an orphaned old-layout plugin forever, and a later uninstall leaves it behind. If a 1.x OpenCode still loads it, it would run alongside the new plugin and both would write the active marker.",
